  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Pod 100 ORGANIZATION, DEFINITIONS, AND PUBLIC INFORMATION\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #14372, effective 9-19-25, repealed Pod 103.03, the definition of “Staff”, Pod 105.03 titled “Tentative Decisions”, and Pod 106.01 titled “Subcommittees”.\n\nAs practice and procedure rules, the rules in Document #14372 will not expire except pursuant to RSA 541-A:17, II.",
